WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.281
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emma. Welcome to Online Grammar, level A one.

2
00:00:05.581 --> 00:00:08.990
Hi! I'm Visal. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:15.112
Unit six: Basic Prepositions (in/on/at). Today you will say where things are with in, on and at.

4
00:00:15.412 --> 00:00:17.948
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.249
Part one: words. You will learn eight new words.

6
00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:23.748
In.

7
00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.494
In means inside something.

8
00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:28.549
The pen is in the bag.

9
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.593
Your turn. Say: In.

10
00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:35.156
In.

11
00:00:35.917 --> 00:00:36.558
On.

12
00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:39.596
On means touching the top of something.

13
00:00:40.183 --> 00:00:41.521
The book is on the desk.

14
00:00:42.117 --> 00:00:44.061
Your turn. Say: On.

15
00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:47.634
On.

16
00:00:48.383 --> 00:00:49.094
At.

17
00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:52.350
At means used for a point or a place.

18
00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:54.125
I am at school.

19
00:00:54.717 --> 00:00:56.789
Your turn. Say: At.

20
00:00:59.633 --> 00:01:00.321
At.

21
00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:02.189
In the box.

22
00:01:03.183 --> 00:01:05.485
In the box means inside the container.

23
00:01:06.083 --> 00:01:07.560
The toy is in the box.

24
00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:11.000
Your turn. Say: In the box.

25
00:01:13.833 --> 00:01:15.009
In the box.

26
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:16.890
On the table.

27
00:01:17.883 --> 00:01:20.533
On the table means touching the top of the table.

28
00:01:21.117 --> 00:01:22.536
The cup is on the table.

29
00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:25.640
Your turn. Say: On the table.

30
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:29.675
On the table.

31
00:01:30.417 --> 00:01:31.325
At school.

32
00:01:32.317 --> 00:01:34.792
At school means in the place where you study.

33
00:01:35.383 --> 00:01:36.791
She is at school now.

34
00:01:37.383 --> 00:01:39.850
Your turn. Say: At school.

35
00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:43.887
At school.

36
00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:45.767
Location.

37
00:01:46.783 --> 00:01:49.305
Location means the place where something is.

38
00:01:49.917 --> 00:01:51.649
The location is near the park.

39
00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:55.065
Your turn. Say: Location.

40
00:01:57.900 --> 00:01:58.971
Location.

41
00:01:59.717 --> 00:02:00.613
Place.

42
00:02:01.617 --> 00:02:04.394
Place means a particular area or position.

43
00:02:04.983 --> 00:02:06.774
This is my favourite place.

44
00:02:07.383 --> 00:02:09.676
Your turn. Say: Place.

45
00:02:12.533 --> 00:02:13.418
Place.

46
00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:17.629
Part two: dialogue. Let's listen to a conversation.

47
00:02:18.483 --> 00:02:21.612
Visal, where is your pen? Is it in or on the bag?

48
00:02:22.717 --> 00:02:30.701
It is in the bag. We use in when something is inside. We use on when it touches the top, like on the desk.

49
00:02:31.817 --> 00:02:32.632
And at?

50
00:02:33.717 --> 00:02:42.321
We use at for a place or a point. I am at school. She is at the bus stop. He is at home. At is for general places.

51
00:02:43.417 --> 00:02:44.778
How can I remember them?

52
00:02:45.883 --> 00:02:55.411
Think: in is inside, on is on top, and at is a point. In the box, on the table, at school. Learn each as a small phrase.

53
00:02:56.567 --> 00:02:58.195
Part three: grammar.

54
00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:03.163
Grammar focus: Prepositions of place: in and on and at.

55
00:03:03.463 --> 00:03:04.603
Look at the pattern.

56
00:03:05.317 --> 00:03:06.782
The pen is in the bag.

57
00:03:07.683 --> 00:03:09.091
The cup is on the table.

58
00:03:09.983 --> 00:03:11.147
She is at school.

59
00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:20.871
In = inside, on = on the top, at = a point or a place. Learn fixed phrases: at school, at home, on the table, in the box.

60
00:03:21.617 --> 00:03:24.594
Be careful! Don't say: The book is in the table.

61
00:03:26.533 --> 00:03:28.812
Say: The book is on the table.

62
00:03:29.112 --> 00:03:30.914
Use on for the top of something.

63
00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:34.190
Part four: reading. Read and listen.

64
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.082
Where Is It?.

65
00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:39.171
My book is in my bag, and my bag is on the chair.

66
00:03:40.167 --> 00:03:41.609
I am at school now.

67
00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:44.205
The teacher is at the board.

68
00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:48.535
A map is on the wall, and some toys are in the box.

69
00:03:49.533 --> 00:03:51.591
My home is a good place to study.

70
00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:56.551
Part five: quiz. Five questions. Are you ready?

71
00:03:57.417 --> 00:03:59.091
The cat is blank the box.

72
00:03:59.391 --> 00:04:02.069
A, in. B, on. C, at.

73
00:04:05.633 --> 00:04:07.737
The answer is A: in.

74
00:04:08.883 --> 00:04:10.477
The book is blank the desk.

75
00:04:10.777 --> 00:04:13.513
A, in. B, on. C, at.

76
00:04:17.067 --> 00:04:18.730
The answer is B: on.

77
00:04:19.883 --> 00:04:21.349
She is blank school.

78
00:04:21.649 --> 00:04:24.524
A, in. B, on. C, at.

79
00:04:28.067 --> 00:04:29.521
The answer is C: at.

80
00:04:30.683 --> 00:04:32.335
Which sentence is correct?

81
00:04:32.635 --> 00:04:38.273
A, The cup is at the table.. B, The cup is on the table.. C, The cup is in the table..

82
00:04:41.833 --> 00:04:44.344
The answer is B: The cup is on the table..

83
00:04:45.483 --> 00:04:48.388
According to the reading, where is the writer's book?

84
00:04:48.688 --> 00:04:52.539
A, on the chair. B, in the bag. C, at the board.

85
00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:57.983
The answer is B: in the bag.

86
00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:02.003
Part six: speaking. It's your turn to talk.

87
00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:06.211
Where is your pen right now? Use 'in', 'on', or 'at'.

88
00:05:15.017 --> 00:05:16.587
Now listen to Visal.

89
00:05:16.887 --> 00:05:30.318
My pen is in my bag right now. My bag is on the floor next to my chair. I am at home, so my pen is at home too. I use in for inside, on for the top of something, and at for a place.

90
00:05:30.618 --> 00:05:32.490
Excellent answer, Visal!

91
00:05:33.383 --> 00:05:39.147
Great work! Now you can use eight new words and prepositions of place: in and on and at.

92
00:05:39.447 --> 00:05:43.388
Today's value is tidiness. Put your things back in their place.

93
00:05:43.688 --> 00:05:45.946
See you in Unit seven. Goodbye!

94
00:05:46.246 --> 00:05:50.280
Thank you, Ms. Emma! Bye, everyone!

